The '''North Pole''' is a special [[Events|Christmas Event]] island in the game that can be found in the [[First Sea|First]],[[Second Sea|Second]], and [[Third Sea|Third]] seas (in [[Sea of Treats]], the island is permanently there, even named North Pole and also has local quests, just without the [[Christmas Event]] [[NPCs]] if the event hasn’t started). 

==Location==
===First Sea===
The North Pole is located next to the [[Frozen Village]] in the [[First Sea]]. Simply go to the Frozen Village, and look to the right of the Frozen Village. The player will find it there if the [[Events|Christmas Event]] is on.

===Second Sea===
The North Pole is near the [[Cursed Ship]] in the [[Second Sea]]. The player has to look at the direction of [[Kingdom of Rose]] from the [[Cursed Ship]], and then look to their right. The player will find it there if the [[Events|Christmas event]] is on.

===Third Sea===
The North Pole is the Candy Cane sub-island located in [[Sea of Treats]]. This island stays in the [[Third Sea]] even if the [[Events|Christmas Event]] is over.

==Event==
{{Main|Presents}}
The '''Presents Event''' is an event that occurs every 2 hours(the time is XX:00(UTC),with XX is an odd number,example 5:00PM) which gives away fruits for free. During this event, a massive gift will land on the center of the island, which will later open automatically, and release a gift for everyone that is on the center of the island. Note that the user can only pick up a certain gift from this event.
The event will also send 4 different messages throughout the system before the countdown reached 00:00.
