==Notes==
* The [[Candy Cane Land]] is still and will always be in the [[Third Sea]] even if the Christmas event is over, as it is an important [[:Category:Islands|island]] that contains [[enemies]] for players to level up on.
* The countdown for the presents is the same in all servers.
* [[Portal]]'s {{Ability|Portal|C}} ability cannot teleport here.

